@HolidayApp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5095

### Sync US holidays for 2024
POST {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2024,
  "countryCode": "US"
}

###

### Sync DE holidays for 2024
POST {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2024,
  "countryCode": "DE"
}

###

### Sync GB holidays for 2024
POST {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2024,
  "countryCode": "GB"
}

###

### Validation error — invalid country code
POST {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 2024,
  "countryCode": "INVALID"
}

###

### Validation error — year out of range
POST {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/sync
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "year": 1800,
  "countryCode": "US"
}

###

### Last 3 celebrated holidays for US
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/US/last-celebrated
Accept: application/json

###

### Last 3 celebrated holidays for DE
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/DE/last-celebrated
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error — invalid country code
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/INVALID/last-celebrated
Accept: application/json

###

### Non-weekend counts — multiple countries
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/non-weekend-count?year=2024&countryCodes=US&countryCodes=DE&countryCodes=GB
Accept: application/json

###

### Non-weekend counts — single country
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/non-weekend-count?year=2024&countryCodes=PL
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error — no country codes
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/non-weekend-count?year=2024
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error — invalid year
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/non-weekend-count?year=1800&countryCodes=US
Accept: application/json

###

### Common holidays — US and DE in 2024
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/common?year=2024&countryCode1=US&countryCode2=DE
Accept: application/json

###

### Common holidays — GB and DE in 2024
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/common?year=2024&countryCode1=GB&countryCode2=DE
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error — same country codes
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/common?year=2024&countryCode1=US&countryCode2=US
Accept: application/json

###

### Validation error — missing second country code
GET {{HolidayApp_HostAddress}}/api/holidays/common?year=2024&countryCode1=US
Accept: application/json

